EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hello {!Contact.FirstName},

Thank you for contacting Admission Services at Arizona State University. We have received your recent request to waive our application fee. Unfortunately, we are unable to approve your request. Application fee waivers are available only for applicants who are Arizona residents, currently attending high school and who will be first-time freshmen at ASU.

This fee is required to process your application. We will await payment prior to any further processing. If you have any questions, please contact me at {!User.Recruiter_Email__c}. I am your personal contact for admission-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admission process.

Sincerely,

{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}
Admission Services
{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}
{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}

If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.

{!Case.Thread_Id}
